diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..51ecda7e5436e7ab8b2863e573e6ac94c0f19a88 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,10 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an in-memory rental service. Add a board or sail with an integer daily
+price in euro cents, then use `quote()` to price a complete UTC-day period or `book()` to reserve it.
+Periods are half-open (`[start, end)`), must start and end at midnight UTC, and cannot overlap for the
+same item. Booking IDs are deterministic (`booking-1`, `booking-2`, and so on).
